From 6bba01275fd05a9109db59bb87ae489847b271c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 06:13:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix owner reference-photo upload being unreachable without a
 matched driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause: the Owner Dashboard only ever listed matched drivers (from the
fleet summary, which requires an approved application), and both existing
entry points to "Manage Reference Photos" lived on driver-specific screens.
An owner with no driver matched yet — the normal state right after listing
a car, and exactly when reference photos are meant to be taken — had no way
to reach that screen at all. Confirmed against production data: only 1 of
10+ owners with listed cars had ever successfully added reference photos.

Adds a "Your Cars" section to the Owner Dashboard, independent of driver
matching, so every owner can always reach reference-photo management for
each car they own.
